eral distillation (pre-training) and task-specific distillation (fine-tuning).', 'A learning approach that involves two distinct stages: general distillation (pre-training) and task-specific distillation (fine-tuning).', 'A learning approach that involves two distinct stages: general distillation (pre-training) and task-specific distillation (fine-tuning).', 'A learning approach that involves two distinct stages: general distillation (pre-training) and task-specific distillation (fine-tuning).'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Data augmentation': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'method', 'method'], 'description': ['Techniques used to increase the diversity and size of the training dataset, often used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'Techniques used to increase the diversity and size of the training dataset, often used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'Techniques used to increase the diversity and size of the training dataset, often used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'Techniques used to increase the diversity and size of the training dataset, often used in the task-specific distillation stage.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'General distillation': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'method', 'method'], 'description': ['The pre-training stage of the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize the student model.', 'The pre-training stage of the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize the student model.', 'The pre-training stage of the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize the student model.', 'The pre-training stage of the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize the student model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'method', 'method'], 'description': ['The fine-tuning stage of the two-stage learning framework, leveraging data augmentation and a fine-tuned teacher model.', 'The fine-tuning stage of the two-stage learning framework, leveraging data augmentation and a fine-tuned teacher model.', 'The fine-tuning stage of the two-stage learning framework, leveraging data augmentation and a fine-tuned teacher model.', 'The fine-tuning stage of the two-stage learning framework, leveraging data augmentation and a fine-tuned teacher model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Accelerate inference': {'type': ['task', 'task', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ['The objective of improving the speed at which a model can make predictions.', 'The objective of improving the speed at which a model can make predictions.', 'The objective of improving the speed at which a model can make predictions.', 'The objective of improving the speed at which a model can make predictions.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Reduce model size': {'type': ['task', 'task', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ['The objective of decreasing the number of parameters in a model, making it more efficient.', 'The objective of decreasing the number of parameters in a model, making it more efficient.', 'The objective of decreasing the number of parameters in a model, making it more efficient.', 'The objective of decreasing the number of parameters in a model, making it more efficient.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Maintain performance': {'type': ['task', 'task', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ['The objective of preserving the accuracy and effectiveness of a model after it has been distilled or reduced in size.', 'The objective of preserving the accuracy and effectiveness of a model after it has been distilled or reduced in size.', 'The objective of preserving the accuracy and effectiveness of a model after it has been distilled or reduced in size.', 'The objective of preserving the accuracy and effectiveness of a model after it has been distilled or reduced in size.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'BERT': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'method', 'me